fted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"druid-g549","druid-g625","druid-g559","druid-g303","druid-g501","druid-g590","druid-g271","druid-g63","druid-g277","druid-g286","druid-g99","druid-g495","druid-g618","druid-g256"}},{b="30-39",no="Best match per slot for Feral (Cat) by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"druid-g727","druid-g87","druid-g734","druid-g681","druid-g697","druid-g733","druid-g758","druid-g649","druid-g767","druid-g692","druid-g646","druid-g753","druid-g704","druid-g729","druid-g739"}},{b="40-49",no="Best match per slot for Feral (Cat) by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"druid-g827","druid-g301","druid-g51","druid-g890","druid-g918","druid-g843","druid-g116","druid-g283","druid-g127","druid-g875","druid-g914","druid-g159","druid-g804","druid-g82","druid-g893","druid-g290"}},{b="50-60",no="Best match per slot for Feral (Cat) by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"druid-g1114","druid-g1044","druid-g969","druid-g1163","druid-g1110","druid-g38","druid-g1109","druid-g993","druid-g980","druid-g1023","druid-g1210","druid-g975","druid-g1153","druid-g67","druid-g1091","druid-g1111"}}},title="Feral (Cat) | WoW Forever Druid Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[727]},{id="journey",x=S[594]},{id="talents",x=S[514]},{id="stats",x=S[622]},{id="combat",x=S[623]},{id="macros",x=S[641]},{id="dungeons",x=S[565]},{id="professions",x=S[595]},{id="crafting",x=S[579]},{id="questgear",x=S[556]},{id=S[507],x=S[671]}},asideNote=S[114],talentString="050022000000000050230302123110124011055",ranks={{tree="Balance",name="Genesis",r=5,max=5},{tree="Balance",name=S[557],r=2,max=2},{tree="Balance",name=S[689],r=2,max=2},{tree=S[119],name="Ferocity",r=5,max=5},{tree=S[119],name=S[674],r=2,max=2},{tree=S[119],name=S[634],r=3,max=3},{tree=S[119],name="Thick Hide",r=3,max=3},{tree=S[119],name="Savage Fury",r=2,max=2},{tree=S[119],name=S[759],r=1,max=1},{tree=S[119],name=S[675],r=2,max=2},{tree=S[119],name=S[645],r=3,max=3},{tree=S[119],name="Lacerate",r=1,max=1},{tree=S[119],name=S[830],r=1,max=1},{tree=S[119],name=S[626],r=1,max=1},{tree=S[119],name=S[658],r=2,max=2},{tree=S[119],name=S[729],r=4,max=5},{tree=S[119],name="Primal Bite",r=1,max=1},{tree=S[119],name=S[804],r=1,max=1},{tree="Restoration",name=S[535],r=5,max=5},{tree="Restoration",name="Naturalist",r=5,max=5}},order={{l1=10,l2=14,tree=S[119],name="Ferocity",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=15,l2=17,tree=S[119],name="Thick Hide",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=18,l2=19,tree=S[119],name=S[674],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=20,l2=20,tree=S[119],name=S[759],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=21,l2=22,tree=S[119],name="Savage Fury",r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=23,l2=24,tree=S[119],name=S[675],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=25,l2=25,tree=S[119],name=S[830],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=26,l2=26,tree=S[119],name="Lacerate",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=27,l2=29,tree=S[119],name=S[634],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=30,l2=30,tree=S[119],name=S[626],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=31,l2=32,tree=S[119],name=S[658],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=33,l2=35,tree=S[119],name=S[645],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=36,l2=39,tree=S[119],name=S[729],r1=1,r2=4,max=5},{l1=40,l2=40,tree=S[119],name="Primal Bite",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=41,l2=41,tree=S[119],name=S[804],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=42,l2=46,tree="Balance",name="Genesis",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=47,l2=48,tree="Balance",name=S[689],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=49,l2=53,tree="Restoration",name=S[535],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=54,l2=58,tree="Restoration",name="Naturalist",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=59,l2=60,tree="Balance",name=S[557],r1=1,r2=2,max=2}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[558]},{t="h1",x="Feral (Cat)",sub=S[643]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Rake, Claw or Shred and Rip in Cat Form, Shifting Power to turn mana into Energy at 41, and Bear Form whenever a pull gets dangerous. Cat and Bear attacks use your weapon’s damage per second in Forever."},{t="pills",list={S[635],"Open-world leveling build",S[596]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[728]},{t="h2",x=S[470]},{t="p",x="These stages follow the talent order below: a Feral DPS build that goes straight down the Feral tree and finishes in Balance and Restoration."},{t="p",s="level",x="10–19 · Before Cat Form"},{t="p",x="Ferocity 5/5 (10–14) makes Claw, Rake, Maul, Swipe and Primal Bite cost 5 less, Thick Hide 3/3 (15–17) adds armor, and Feral Swiftness 2/2 (18–19) adds 30% Cat run speed and 4% dodge. Until Cat Form at 20 you fight with Moonfire, Wrath and Bear Form from 10."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–35 · Cat Form core"},{t="p",x="Feral Charge at 20, Savage Fury 2/2 (21–22) and Sharpened Claws 2/2 (23–24) come first. Predatory Discipline at 25 lets Ferocious Bite deal extra damage from your excess Energy without spending it, Lacerate at 26 adds a stacking bleed, then Feral Instinct 3/3 (27–29), Leader of the Pack at 30 (3% critical strike for your group in forms), Natural Instinct 2/2 (31–32) and Predatory Strikes 3/3 (33–35)."},{t="p",s="level",x="36–60 · Bleeds, Primal Bite and Shifting Power"},{t="p",x="Rend and Tear 4/5 (36–39) adds damage on bleeding targets, Primal Bite arrives at 40, and Shifting Power at 41 converts mana into 40 Energy. Genesis 5/5 (42–46) and Nature’s Reach 2/2 (47–48) come from Balance, then Heart of the Wild 5/5 (49–53), Naturalist 5/5 (54–58) and Nature’s Majesty 2/2 (59–60) finish the build."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[515]},{t="h2",x=S[635]},{t="p",x=S[81]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[566]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[502]},{t="p",x=S[145]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Play Cat Form solo and Bear Form for dangerous pulls and dungeons. With Predatory Discipline, Ferocious Bite keeps your excess Energy, so you do not need to pool Energy for it."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[624]},{t="h2",x=S[541]},{t="p",x="Cat Form uses your weapon’s damage per second, so a high-DPS two-hander is your biggest upgrade. Agility and Strength help when weapons are close."},{t="h3",x=S[691]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[730],x="two-handed maces, staves and polearms"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Agility",x="attack power, crit and armor"},{t="stat",i=3,b="Strength",x="attack power"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Weapon speed does not matter: your forms have a fixed attack speed and only the weapon’s damage per second counts."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[730],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Expertise",x="to 6.5%"},{t="stat",i=3,b="Hit chance",x="to 8%"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Agility",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b="Strength",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Critical strike and attack power are worth about as much as Agility and Strength."},{t="p",s="notice",x="Melee hit cap: 8% for special attacks against raid bosses. Expertise removes dodge at 6.5% and parry at 14% (parry only matters from the front). The level 60 list is an early estimate: the beta stopped at level 30, so expect changes once endgame gear is known. A big upgrade in a lower stat can still beat a small one in a higher stat."},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[542]},{t="h2",x=S[580]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority list, not a fixed loop. Cat Form and Prowl arrive at 20, Rake at 24, Ravage at 32, Pounce at 36 and Shifting Power (talent) at 41."},{t="h4",x=S[929]},{t="p",x="Keep Mark of the Wild and Thorns active. Open from Prowl with Ravage (32) or Pounce (36) from behind; before that, pull with Moonfire or a free Faerie Fire, which costs nothing in Cat or Bear Form."},{t="h4",x="Bleeds"},{t="p",x="Keep Rake on any target that will live 6 seconds or longer, and a five-combo-point Rip on the same targets. Rend and Tear adds damage against bleeding enemies."},{t="h4",x="Builders"},{t="p",x="Shred when you are behind the enemy or have Clearcasting, otherwise Claw. Pool Energy so Rake and Rip have as little downtime as possible."},{t="h4",x="Finishers"},{t="p",x="Ferocious Bite only when the enemy is about to die (3 seconds or less) and you have more than three combo points."},{t="h4",x="Energy and mana"},{t="p",x="From 41, use Shifting Power when no Energy will be wasted, but keep mana for healing."},{t="h4",x="Dangerous pulls"},{t="p",x="Shift to Bear Form for armor and AoE with Swipe; from 44, Barkskin works in forms. Shift out for Regrowth or Healing Touch between enemies."},{t="abil",names={"Cat Form","Prowl","Rake","Claw","Shred","Rip","Ferocious Bite","Ravage",S[804],"Faerie Fire","Dash","Bear Form"}},{t="h3",x=S[614]},{t="p",x="Cat Form attacks use your equipped weapon’s damage per second; the form sets attack speed, so compare weapon DPS first. Use two-handed maces, staves and polearms (polearms can be learned from 20), with Strength and Agility on armor. Hit, critical strike and Stamina help on hard pulls."},{t="p",x="Weapon path: Segmented Spider Leg (Ruins of Lordaeron, 15), Smite’s Mighty Hammer (Deadmines, 18), Graverobber’s Shovel (Stockade, 23), Manual Crowd Pummeler (Gnomeregan, 29), Loksey’s Training Stick (Scarlet Monastery, 31), Grimlok’s Charge (Uldaman, 42), then Thorium Poleaxe (52) and Hammer of the Titans or Legionite Glaive (58) from Blacksmithing."},{t="h3",x=S[543]},{t="p",x=S[74]},{t="p",x=S[109]},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[644]},{t="h2",x=S[455]},{t="p",x=S[76]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[62]},{t="macro",n=S[581],x=S[224],code=S[213]},{t="macro",n=S[625],x=S[230],code=S[232]},{t="macro",n=S[582],x=S[227],code=S[214]},{t="macro",n=S[597],x=S[225],code=S[222]},{t="macro",n=S[615],x=S[231],code=S[258]},{t="macro",n=S[464],x=S[154],code=S[142]},{t="macro",n=S[492],x=S[173],code=S[393]},{t="macro",n=S[583],x=S[223],code=S[255]},{t="macro",n=S[616],x=S[238],code=S[351]},{t="macro",n="Shred, or Shifting Power with Shift",x="Shred in Cat Form; hold Shift to convert mana into Energy with Shifting Power (talent). Shred still needs you behind the enemy.",code="#showtooltip\n/startattack [nomod:shift,harm,nodead]\n/cast [mod:shift] Shifting Power; [harm,nodead] Shred"},{t="macro",n="Dash from Cat Form",x="Enters Cat Form if needed and uses Dash; press again after changing form if it does not fire.",code="#showtooltip Dash\n/cast [noform:3] Cat Form\n/cast Dash"},{t="macro",n=S[792],x="In Cat Form, leaps behind the enemy under your pointer or your target; in Bear Form, charges and interrupts.",code=S[417]},{t="macro",n="Rake with auto-attack",x="Starts auto-attack and applies Rake to your target. Not tested in game.",code="#showtooltip Rake\n/startattack [harm,nodead]\n/cast [harm,nodead] Rake"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[318]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[672]},{t="h2",x=S[503]},{t="p",x=S[93]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[94]},{t="p",s="notice",x="Feral (Cat) loot selection · 1 November 2026. Leather with Strength, Agility, attack power, hit and critical strike, physical jewelry and cloaks, and two-handed maces, staves and polearms (Cat attacks use weapon damage per second). Cloth, caster gear, mail, plate, shields, swords, axes, wands and ranged weapons are left out. Pure Stamina pieces belong to the Tank page."},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[544]},{t="h2",x=S[493]},{t="p",x=S[106]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[567]},{t="h2",x=S[471]},{t="p",x="These are items to compare, not a mandatory shopping list. Brackets are 1–9, 10–19, 20–29, 30–39, 40–49, 50–59 and level 60. They use the item’s equip/use requirement, not crafting skill; items with no level requirement are placed by item level. Druids wear cloth and leather and use staves, maces, daggers, fist weapons and polearms (train polearms at a weapon master); this page shows only the pieces that suit Feral (Cat). Unknown item requirements remain separate. A published recipe does not establish that its trainer, materials or final acquisition path are available in the beta."},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[545]},{t="h2",x=S[444]},{t="p",x=S[39]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[507]},{t="kicker",x=S[673]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[123]}}},{id="feral-tank",name=S[974],token="TANK",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-druid-1","druid-g142","druid-g224","druid-g238","druid-g36","druid-g86","druid-g115","druid-g211","druid-g239","druid-g299","druid-g308","druid-g323","druid-g56","druid-g80","druid-g325","druid-g279","druid-g258","druid-g55","druid-g72","druid-g157","druid-g182","druid-g209","druid-g1","druid-g14","druid-g35","druid-g124","druid-g252","druid-g20","druid-g24","druid-g63","druid-g83","druid-g227","druid-g286","druid-g126","druid-g149","druid-g40","druid-g276","druid-g294","druid-g50","druid-g145","druid-g168","druid-g201","druid-g293","druid-g57","druid-g74","druid-g130","druid-g131","druid-g221","druid-g288","druid-g310","druid-g311","druid-g108","druid-g120","druid-g123","druid-g316","druid-g320","druid-g260","druid-g328","druid-g256","druid-g99","druid-g175","druid-g264","druid-g275","druid-g277","druid-g296","druid-g31","druid-g70","druid-g148","druid-g271","druid-g89","druid-g315","druid-g143","druid-g9","druid-g65","druid-g185","druid-g235","druid-g202","druid-g285","druid-g694","druid-g61","druid-g69","druid-g707","druid-g215","druid-g85","druid-g87","druid-g199","druid-g272","druid-g273","druid-g137","druid-g226","druid-g263","druid-g17","druid-g96","druid-g162","druid-g43","druid-g135","druid-g159","druid-g251","druid-g280","druid-g136","druid-g283","druid-g28","druid-g44","druid-g128","druid-g139","druid-g240","druid-g250","druid-g127","d